---
kind: lore
id: spine.services
title: Monster Centers and Marts (fallbacks)
---

// The fallback nurse and clerk for any town whose area has not written its
// own heal / shop beat (areas answer heal@town.<town> at priority 0 or more).
// (0.27) A kind beat for every town, so the fallback names the town by its
// label; it cannot ::use the nurse component, whose `town` param takes a
// literal member only (not occasion.target), so the nurse's lines are here.
<beat id="centerFallback" on="heal" target="kind:town" title="Monster Center" priority="-100" once="false">
  @nurse{code="0010"}: Welcome to the {{occasion.target}} Monster Center!
  @nurse{code="0020"}: We restore tired monsters to full health. I'll take yours for a moment.
  ::heal
  ::sfx{sound="center-jingle"}
  @nurse{code="0030"}: Thank you for waiting. Your monsters are fighting fit! We hope to see you again.
</beat>

<beat id="martFallback" on="shop" title="Mart" priority="-100" once="false">
  ::use{component="shop" stock="basicStock" instance="use-001"}
</beat>
